  "title": "epan: Fix ex_opt_get_next leak.",
  "description": "Change ex_opt_get_next to return a non-const char pointer; It's designed so\nthat the caller owns the returned heap pointer, so the caller should be allowed\nto modify or free it if it wants.\n\nFix the callsites to always free the returned string.",
